> Jeremiah DeWitt Weiner wrote:
> > killed by a residual undead turning effect.
> How do you get *that* one?

This can happen if you pray as an undead creature to a lawful or neutral
god. ("Vile creature, thou durst call upon me?"/"Walk no more, perversion
of nature!")

(Interestingly, in a wizard mode experiment I polymorphed into a gnome
mummy, prayed, got killed, returned to human form, and /then/ I was called
a "vile creature" and lost my hp. Maybe there should be another message
in this case.)

